## 4. Interfaces

```python
from typing import Dict, List, Optional
from dataclasses import dataclass

@dataclass
class ContextPackage:
    package_id: str
    mission_objective: str
    constraints: List[dict]
    decisions: List[dict]
    evidence: List[dict]
    open_questions: List[str]
    next_action: str

class StateStore:
    def create_mission(self, objective: str, owner: str) -> str: ...
    def get_mission(self, mission_id: str) -> dict: ...
    def record_decision(self, mission_id: str, subject: str, option: str, rationale: str) -> str: ...
    def record_evidence(self, mission_id: str, provenance: str) -> str: ...
    def detect_conflict(self, record_a_id: str, record_b_id: str) -> str: ...

class ContextEngine:
    def build_context(self, mission_id: str, checkpoint_id: str, policy: str) -> ContextPackage: ...
    def create_fresh_context(self, mission_id: str, task: str) -> ContextPackage: ...
    def create_adversarial_context(self, mission_id: str, proposal_id: str) -> ContextPackage: ...

class HandoffManager:
    def create_checkpoint(self, mission_id: str, state_rev: str, repo_rev: str, next_action: str) -> str: ...
    def restore_checkpoint(self, checkpoint_id: str) -> dict: ...
```

## 5. Data Flow (Session Handoff & Model Switch)
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant AgentA as Model A (e.g. Claude)
    participant Handoff as Handoff Manager
    participant Store as State Store
    participant Engine as Context Engine
    participant AgentB as Model B (e.g. Gemini)

    Note over AgentA,Store: Session 1
    AgentA->>Store: record_decision(D-01)
    AgentA->>Store: record_evidence(E-05)
    AgentA->>Handoff: create_checkpoint()
    Handoff->>Store: save_state()
    Handoff-->>AgentA: Checkpoint C-10
    
    Note over AgentA,AgentB: Process Restart / Model Switch
    
    AgentB->>Engine: build_context(C-10, policy=FULL_CONTINUATION)
    Engine->>Store: get_state(C-10)
    Store-->>Engine: Raw State
    Engine->>Engine: Filter & Rank Context
    Engine-->>AgentB: Context Package
    AgentB->>AgentB: Resume Mission
```

## 6. State Machines
### Decision Lifecycle
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed
    Proposed --> Accepted: Verifier confirms evidence & constraints
    Proposed --> Rejected: Violates invariants / lacks evidence
    Accepted --> Superseded: New decision replaces old
    Accepted --> Disputed: Contradictory evidence discovered
    Rejected --> Reopened: Underlying assumptions change
    Disputed --> Accepted: Re-verified
    Disputed --> Rejected: Original premise invalidated
```

### Epistemic Promotion (Fact Lifecycle)
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Claim : Model outputs assertion
    Claim --> Observation : Candidate evidence retrieved
    Observation --> Fact : Verification / Grounding successful
    Observation --> Hypothesis : Verification inconclusive
    Fact --> Stale : Underlying state/repo changes
    Hypothesis --> Fact : Additional evidence gathered
```
